ount":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OUTwI15MSuK-MoB_QErmog","review_id":"B3TnTJ2j5Lzudqw9WstkOQ","date":"2018-12-20T19:28:25","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9635496139526367,"text_excerpt":"This place right here is me and my guys spot!! He loves a good cigar and drink. Me on the other hand...I'm a food and drink kind of girl. We've been here several times and every time I order the jerk wings and fries. I always add the jerk spice to my fries too. I ordered the chargrilled oysters once and was not impressed. :-( The atmosphere is great although we've had a couple of \"straight face, not so happy to serve\" bartenders. We always have a good time tho be it relaxing, smoking, and listening to the DJ or watching a game on the big screens. There's a new location that I find a lot better and The wings there are made with love (much more flavorful). Ha!! The bartenders and servers ar..."},{"business_id":"OUTwI15MSuK-MoB_QErmog","review_id":"R0hK6V3hwhM0-Xz7lOn8ww","date":"2017-08-12T16:33:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.945824146270752,"text_excerpt":"My girl Dee my fave bartender. Definitely a place I would frequent once a week. Great happy hour specials and music. The char-grilled oysters are so good and the wings are to die. People can go out to back area to smoke premium cigars or the in the smoke room. I would request adding a turkey burger to the menu."},{"business_id":"OUTwI15MSuK-MoB_QErmog","review_id":"9GcWs1eOR2vydUKU08FWkg","date":"2018-01-10T03:14:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9357436895370483,"text_excerpt":"My first time here and I loved it. The people were friendly. The drinks were great. I was most impressed by the outdoors, where you can smoke a great cigar while watching tv in a cozy section. I will definitely be back to try their menu"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
